    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d2">

                <pb facs="0127" n="3" xml:id="pg3"/>

                <head>No. 2.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Osborn
                        to Mr. Evarts</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Buenos Ayres</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1881-01-13"><hi rendition="#italic">January</hi> 13, 1881</date>.
                        (Received March 8.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 313.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: The Government of the United States of
                    Colombia having addressed a note to this government informing it that a compact
                    had been entered into between that government and Chili to submit all questions
                    in dispute between them to arbitration, and at the same time invited the
                    Argentine Government to join the other republics of South America by
                    representation in a congress to meet in Colombia for the purpose of effecting
                    similar compacts between the governments so represented, Dr. Iregoyen, Argentine
                    minister of foreign affairs, in behalf of his government replied, under date of
                    December 30th ultimo, a copy of which I have the honor to inclose herewith.</p>
                <p>I have the honor, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>THOS. O. OSBORN.</signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d2-a1.xml" xpointer="d2-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
